---
layout: base.njk
title: "Blog — Penumbra Forge"
description: "Technical write-ups on security engineering, tool architecture, and lessons from incident response."
permalink: /blog/
---

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/blog.css?v={{ assetv }}">

{% include "header.njk" %}

<div class="blog-page">
  <div class="blog-hero">
    <div class="blog-hero-label">Blog</div>
    <h1>Building in the open</h1>
    <p class="blog-hero-sub">Write-ups on security engineering, how these tools are built, and things I've run into at work.</p>
  </div>

  {%- for post in collections.blog | reverse %}{% if post.data.cardTitle %}
  <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="blog-post-card">
    <div class="blog-post-meta">
      <span class="blog-post-date">{{ post.data.date | postDate }}</span>
      {%- for tag in post.data.postTags %}
      <span class="blog-post-tag">{{ tag }}</span>
      {%- endfor %}
      <span class="blog-post-read">{{ post.data.readTime }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="blog-post-title">{{ post.data.cardTitle }}</div>
    <p class="blog-post-excerpt">{{ post.data.excerpt }}</p>
  </a>
  {% endif %}{%- endfor %}
</div>
